Package: termuj-hexpatch
Version: 1.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @w311ang
Homepage: https://github.com/termux-clone/termux-app
Depends: bzip2, coreutils, dpkg, findutils, grep, gzip, sed, tar, xz-utils
Description: Hexpatch Termux packages for the Termuj app
 apt hook that patches every .deb built for the official Termux app before
 it is unpacked, including the content of compressed archives.
